# Sound masters (ticket 082). 96 kHz 24-bit, 10.19 MB for 20.6 seconds — the
# browser resamples to 48 kHz on arrival, so these are an editing format, not a
# shipping one. The .m4a files beside them ARE committed, because the build
# imports those and a clean clone has to work. `npm run encode:audio` is the
# step between the two.
assets/source/audio/*.wav
